      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "body_paragraph": 1,
          "text": "I am much obliged for your note & the draft of £185 ’ s 13 ’ d 1, which I beg to acknowledge.",
          "html_class": "",
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 1"
        },
        {
          "body_paragraph": 2,
          "text": "I am very glad to hear so excellent an account of the Farm House; & I should much like to see it next summer.",
          "html_class": "",
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 2"
        },
        {
          "body_paragraph": 3,
          "text": "You proposed last half year to pay the Rent direct into my Bankers Mrs Robarts & Curtis & I should greatly prefer this plan & shd be much obliged if for the future you would endeavour so to arrange it—",
          "html_class": "",
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 3"
        },
        {
          "body_paragraph": 4,
          "text": "Believe me dear Sir | Yours very faithfully | C. Darwin",
          "html_class": "",
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 4"
        },
        {
          "body_paragraph": 5,
          "text": "My Father has been ill, but he is now, thank God, greatly better; he has had much suffering.—",
          "html_class": "",
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 5"
        }
      ],
